    "description": "When a self-closing script block is encountered it appears that the state transitions do not account for the closing tag, so the rest of the document is considered to be in the body of the script tag, and so is escaped.\n\nThe unit test HtmlParserTest.handlesKnownEmptyBlocks() will fail if a self-closing script tag is included in the String h."
